cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or the measurement protocol in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "timetable-ab: a controlled cross-language comparison of abstract-structure cost, with full negative and self-refuting results"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered, reproducible cross-language experiment on the cost of abstract
  structures (macros vs. table-driven dispatch), run over seven languages on one frozen
  specification (5 ops), plus fourteen follow-up specifications covering scale, product
  fan-out, expansion-time validation, inlining, iteration, hand-off, and a 30-op crossover.
  The dataset includes every run artefact, the thirty-six invariants and their go-red
  proofs, mutation scores with sample bounds, and a complete record of nineteen occasions
  on which the measurement apparatus itself was wrong.
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/xcw080720/lisp-toolkit"
